      // ⚑ **583 · the label is `told-block-label` and it opens with the row.** The group heading
      // says WHOSE a row is; this says which of that owner's things it is — *profile memory* and
      // *a note the agent was asked to write* are two provenances under one owner, and a reader
      // who cannot tell them apart edits the wrong file.
